WEBVTT

00:16:29.792 --> 00:16:31.417
that's been sliced, diced, layered

00:16:31.417 --> 00:16:35.167
and, God knows, distributed and sold.

00:16:35.167 --> 00:16:38.454
What's the long-term effect of this on us or on music?

00:16:38.454 --> 00:16:39.461
Nobody knows.

00:16:39.461 --> 00:16:43.183
The question remains: What happens when the music stops?

00:16:43.183 --> 00:16:45.134
What sticks with people?

00:16:45.165 --> 00:16:49.117
Now that we have unlimited access to music, what does stick with us?

00:16:49.117 --> 00:16:51.537
Well let me show you a story of what I mean

00:16:51.537 --> 00:16:53.329
by "really sticking with us."

00:16:53.329 --> 00:16:56.417
I was visiting a cousin of mine in an old age home,

00:16:56.417 --> 00:16:59.752
and I spied a very shaky old man

00:16:59.752 --> 00:17:02.029
making his way across the room on a walker.